'''Emergency Contact''' is a [[Cards and Runes#Other|consumable item]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]''.

== Effects ==
* Spawns up to two of {{E|Mom's Hand}}s that fall down onto two random enemies in the room, dealing 40 damage.
** Enemies with more than 40 HP and bosses will be immobilized for 5 seconds, rendering them unable to move and attack.

== Notes ==
* Despite it not being a card, the '''Emergency Contact''' is considered a [[special card]], having a significantly lower chance of appearing compared to other cards.
* {{dlc|nr}} When used on {{E|Hush}}, damage resistance is briefly lowered. This can be used to deal additional damage to it.
* Grabs mom's parts when they're out of the doors when used on {{E|Mom}}. Does nothing if no part and monsters are visible.
* {{E|Isaac}}, {{E|???}}, and first phase of {{E|Hush}} will not retaliate with tears while grabbed.
* The consumable will have no effect if used in a room without enemies.
* {{dlc+|r}} This consumable cannot be mimicked by {{i|Blank Card}}, and {{i|Tarot Cloth}} has no effect on it.{{dlc-}}

